+/**
+ * <star-rating> — a form-associated star-rating control.
+ *
+ * Participates natively in forms via ElementInternals:
+ *  - submits its value under its `name` (nothing is submitted while empty)
+ *  - `required` constraint validation (blocks submit, :invalid, reportValidity)
+ *  - form reset (returns to the `value` attribute, i.e. defaultValue)
+ *  - disabled via its own `disabled` attribute or an ancestor <fieldset disabled>
+ *  - back/forward and autofill state restoration
+ *
+ * Attributes: name, value (default value), max (default 5), required, disabled.
+ * Events: `input` and `change` when the user picks a rating.
+ * Custom state: :state(user-invalid) (mirrored to [data-user-invalid]) once the
+ * user has interacted or attempted to submit while the control is invalid.
