+        <p>Every bag of coffee that leaves our roastery starts with a relationship, not a transaction. Long before a single bean hits our drum roaster, our green coffee buyer has spent weeks on the road visiting the farms, washing stations, and cooperatives we partner with in Ethiopia, Colombia, Guatemala, and Sumatra. We believe the only way to truly understand a coffee is to stand where it grows, talk with the people who tend it, and taste it alongside them.</p>
